  "text": "1\nCommunity\nClassroom\nCalendar\nMembers\nMap\nLeaderboards\nAbout\nChase AI Community\n1\n2\nPete Davis\n9d • ⚡General discussion\nHow Claude Code saved me 2 weeks\nI build trading systems and need a ton of backtesting data... 10 years each for forex, options and stocks/ETFs. The fastest way to grab it before was to go to massive.com and download the flat files.\nAnd that was the problem... bc it meant downloading compressed files for each day over the last 10 years. That's about 6,000 files. Each file contains the price data for every symbol... ie. for Apr 8, 2026, that .csv file has the price data for over 5,000 stocks & ETF's, in 1min timeframe. So that's ... See more\nLike\n7\n11 comments\n1\nRamone Scott\n• 7d\nWow that's mind blowing and amazing bro keep up the good work.\n0\nReply\n2\nPatrick Swierczek\n• 6d\nHey Pete, this is great work! I'm a trader myself and this would be such a huge help since I use Massive.com too. Would you be open to sharing the script with me?\n0\nReply\n2\nPete Davis\n• 6d (edited)\n@Patrick Swierczek what's up brother! Always love meeting other traders!\nTried sending you a DM but it won't let me... shoot me a DM if you can\nFor sure... why don't we hop on a quick zoom and I'll walk you through it. Would love to hear what you're doing as well.\n0\nReply\n2\nPatrick Swierczek\n• 6d\n@Pete Davis I have to be a level 9 contributor to send you a dm, which I'm not there yet. Do you have an instagram I can message you on?\n0\nReply\n2\nPete Davis\n• 6d\n@Patrick Swierczek @realpetedavis… DM me there and I’ll give you my cel\n1\nReply\n2\nPatrick Swierczek\n• 5d\n@Pete Davis messaged you, I think you have to accept it on your end\n0\nReply\n2\nPete Davis\n• 5d\n@Patrick Swierczek I didn't get... what's yours, I'll try it on my end\n0\nReply\n2\nPatrick Swierczek\n• 5d\n@Pete Davis pswierczek1\n0\nReply\n2\nPete Davis\n• 5d\n@Patrick Swierczek I think its bc your profile is private. Accept my follow request and I'll DM you\n1\nReply\n2\nPatrick Swierczek\n• 5d\n@Pete Davis switched it to public for now so you should be ok to dm now\n0\nReply\n2\nPete Davis\n• 5d\n@Patrick Swierczek Boom! done, drop me a whatsapp\n1\nReply\n1\n\n\n\n\n2\nHow Claude Code saved me 2 weeks\nChase AI Community\nskool.com/chase-ai-community\nGo from learning to earning. Join Chase AI+👇\nUpgrade to Chase AI+\n57.5k\nMembers\n239\nOnline\n3\nAdmins\nINVITE PEOPLE\nLeaderboard (30-day)\n1\nVitalii Hryhorenko\n+51\n2\nCharles Dove\n🔥\n+23\n3\nCyber Ai\n+22\n4\nSam Alder\n🔥\n+16\n5\nJonathan Wilson\n+15\nSee all leaderboards\nPowered by",
